  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective to safeguard vulnerable communities and their physical assets from climate change-induced disasters. It aims to address existing institutional, financial and legislative barriers, increasing the climate resilience of vulnerable small-scale rural infrastructure. Output 1 focuses on strengthening the capacity of mandated institutions to assess and manage climate risks in order to 2 | P a g e maintain local infrastructure services. GCF-funded activities will embed new skills,</narrative>
  </description>
